 teaching at the graduate level, preferably in online or hybrid formats. Proficiency with learning management systems (e.g., Brightspace/D2L, Canvas, Blackboard). Willingness and ability to support and promote the Felician Franciscan mission and core values of the University. Salary Range:  $750-1,100 per credit hour To Apply: Send cover letter, current curriculum vitae, and the names and contact information for two professional references electronically to Associate Dean or via USPS to: Dr. Diana Casianos, Associate Dean School of Nursing Felician University 262 S. Main Street Lodi,   New Jersey 07644 Start Date: Review of candidate materials will begin immediately for Spring 2026 start. About Felician University Summer Sports and Gaming Camps Board of Trustees Members Institutional Assessment Accreditations Middle States Self-Study Process Strategic Plan Fast Facts Careers at Felician Associate Director of Student Financial Services Operations Full-time Faculty – School of Nursing Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Program Analyst – Information Systems Faculty Adjunct – Graduate Nursing Assistant/Associate Professor, Mathematics Part-time Assistant Coach, Men’s Wrestling Associate Director of Student Accounts Clinical Adjunct Faculty, School of Nursing, Traditional ABSN, Rutherfod NJ Assistant Professor, Prelicensure Nursing Adjunct Faculty, Information Literacy Part-Time ESL Instructors  July 15-August 5, 2026 Faculty Adjuncts, Philosophy Security Officers Faculty Adjuncts, School of Business and Information Sciences Instructor, School of Nursing Faculty Adjunct, Communications Assistant Coach, Women’s Soccer Academic Success Coach JV Men’s Soccer Coach and Athletics Coordinator Full Time Faculty, Mathematics Assistant Professor, Cybersecurity and Computer Sciences Adjunct Faculty, Religious Studies Associate Director for Academic Operations Assistant Coach, Men’s Soccer Clinical Adjunct Faculty, Hybrid ABSN, Parsippany, School of Nursing Associ