n wrestling or related sport; strong written and verbal communications skills; proven ability to engage, motivate and direct a team of student athletes of diverse backgrounds and experience levels; detail-oriented; ability to instruct skills associated with wrestling; ability and willingness to work a flexible schedule which includes evenings and weekends; ability to support and promote the Franciscan Felician mission and values of the University. Salary range: $10,000-16,000 To Apply: Send cover letter, resume and 2 professional references electronically the Head Coach or via USPS to Mr. Dale Fava, Head Coach Wrestling Felician University Athletics 1 Felician Way Rutherford, New Jersey 07070 About Felician University Summer Sports and Gaming Camps Board of Trustees Members Institutional Assessment Accreditations Middle States Self-Study Process Strategic Plan Fast Facts Careers at Felician Associate Director of Student Financial Services Operations Full-time Faculty – School of Nursing Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Program Analyst – Information Systems Faculty Adjunct – Graduate Nursing Assistant/Associate Professor, Mathematics Part-time Assistant Coach, Men’s Wrestling Associate Director of Student Accounts Clinical Adjunct Faculty, School of Nursing, Traditional ABSN, Rutherfod NJ Assistant Professor, Prelicensure Nursing Adjunct Faculty, Information Literacy Part-Time ESL Instructors  July 15-August 5, 2026 Faculty Adjuncts, Philosophy Security Officers Faculty Adjuncts, School of Business and Information Sciences Instructor, School of Nursing Faculty Adjunct, Communications Assistant Coach, Women’s Soccer Academic Success Coach JV Men’s Soccer Coach and Athletics Coordinator Full Time Faculty, Mathematics Assistant Professor, Cybersecurity and Computer Sciences Adjunct Faculty, Religious Studies Associate Director for Academic Operations Assistant Coach, Men’s Soccer Clinical Adjunct Faculty, Hybrid ABSN, Parsippany, School of Nursing As