cian Associate Director of Student Accounts IN THIS SECTION About Felician University Summer Sports and Gaming Camps Board of Trustees Members Institutional Assessment Accreditations Middle States Self-Study Process Strategic Plan Fast Facts Careers at Felician Associate Director of Student Financial Services Operations Full-time Faculty – School of Nursing Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Program Analyst – Information Systems Faculty Adjunct – Graduate Nursing Assistant/Associate Professor, Mathematics Part-time Assistant Coach, Men’s Wrestling Associate Director of Student Accounts Clinical Adjunct Faculty, School of Nursing, Traditional ABSN, Rutherfod NJ Assistant Professor, Prelicensure Nursing Adjunct Faculty, Information Literacy Part-Time ESL Instructors  July 15-August 5, 2026 Faculty Adjuncts, Philosophy Security Officers Faculty Adjuncts, School of Business and Information Sciences Instructor, School of Nursing Faculty Adjunct, Communications Assistant Coach, Women’s Soccer Academic Success Coach JV Men’s Soccer Coach and Athletics Coordinator Full Time Faculty, Mathematics Assistant Professor, Cybersecurity and Computer Sciences Adjunct Faculty, Religious Studies Associate Director for Academic Operations Assistant Coach, Men’s Soccer Clinical Adjunct Faculty, Hybrid ABSN, Parsippany, School of Nursing Associate Director of Housing Operations Associate Director of Transfer Student Success Part-Time Professional Science Tutor Administrative Specialist for Student Success & Accessibility Services Building and Grounds Assistant Attitude Against Violence Project Coordinator Assistant/Associate Professor, Chemistry Head Coach, Women’s Acrobatics and Tumbling Assistant Professor, Marketing Assessment Data Coordinator Engagement and Philanthropy Officer Director of Internships and Assessment, School of Education Assistant Sports Information Director and Intramurals Coordinator Assistant Professor, Management and Entrepreneurial Studies Head Coach, Men’s Soccer Head Coach, eSports Prelicensure Nursing Program, Parsippany NJ – Clinical Adjunct Faculty Associate Professor – PsyD Counseling Psychology Program Campus Security: Part-time Security Officer Assistant Director, Center for Career and Professional Development Assistant/Associate Professor of Chemistry Management/Entrepreneurial Studies Faculty Inter-Campus Shuttle Bus Drivers Inter-Campus Shuttle Bus Drivers Half-Time Instructor, Prelicensure Nursing IT Help Desk Support Technician – Temporary Director of Institutional Assessment and Accreditation Full-time Faculty, Prelicensure Nursing Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions Assistant/Associate Professor, Exercise Sports Science Assistant Professor and Academic Fieldwork Coordinator, Master’s Occupational Therapy Program Evening and Weekend Circulation Supervisor Research and Instruction Librarian Faculty Adjunct – Mathematics Assistant Women’s Basketball Coach and Equipment Manager Adjunct Faculty, English Conference and Event Services Directions & Maps On Campus Tours History & Tradition Office of the President Senior Administrative Officers Alumni REED Autism Services Partnership Felician University is presently seeking a highly motivated, detail focused, self-motivated, and goal-oriented financial services professional to serve as Associate Director of Student Accounts.  Reporting to the Director of Student Accounts, the Associate Director has oversight for team development and training, annual audit related requests, and daily operations management of the office. S/he is responsible for the University’s past due accounts receivable management services and internal recovery efforts for the collection of student accounts and refund processes.  The Associate Director supports student retention and enrollment while focusing on the recovery of revenue. Felician University is committed to maintaining a learning and employment environment based upon our core values of Respect for Human Dignity , Compassion , Transformation , Justice and Peace, and Solidarity with People in Need. We offer a  choice of medical, dental, vision, and life insurance benefits, as well as a retirement plan (403B), tuition remission, and generous time off benefits. Required Education: BA/BS degree, Master’s degree preferred.  Educational requirements may be waived for 5-7 years of related experience Qualifications: 3+ years’ of progressively more responsible administrative experience in higher education student financial aid administration; proven leadership and management skills; excellent interpersonal skills; superior verbal and written communications skills, with a proven ability to engage effectively with diverse constituencies; ability to work collaboratively with internal cross-divisional and external partners; superior customer service skills; strong organizational ability; willingness to work flex hours, including evenings and weekends as needed; demonstrated ability to work autonomously with multiple priorities and deadlines; willingness and ability to support and promote the Felician Franciscan mission and values of the University. To Apply: Send cover letter, resume and 2 professional references electronically to: Director or via USPS to: Ms. Kathy Prieto, Director Office of Student Accounts 262 South Main Street Lodi, New Jersey 07644 About Felician University Summer Sports and Gaming Camps Board of Trustees Members Institutional Assessment Accreditations Middle States Self-Study Process Strategic Plan Fast Facts Careers at Felician Associate Director of Student Financial Services Operations Full-time Faculty – School of Nursing Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Program Analyst – Information Systems Faculty Adjunct – Graduate Nursing Assistant/Associate Professor, Mathematics Part-time Assistant Coach, Men’s Wrestling Associate Director of Student Accounts Clinical Adjunct Faculty, School of Nursing, Traditional ABSN, Rutherfod NJ Assistant Profe