lding and Grounds Assistant IN THIS SECTION About Felician University Summer Sports and Gaming Camps Board of Trustees Members Institutional Assessment Accreditations Middle States Self-Study Process Strategic Plan Fast Facts Careers at Felician Associate Director of Student Financial Services Operations Full-time Faculty – School of Nursing Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Program Analyst – Information Systems Faculty Adjunct – Graduate Nursing Assistant/Associate Professor, Mathematics Part-time Assistant Coach, Men’s Wrestling Associate Director of Student Accounts Clinical Adjunct Faculty, School of Nursing, Traditional ABSN, Rutherfod NJ Assistant Professor, Prelicensure Nursing Adjunct Faculty, Information Literacy Part-Time ESL Instructors  July 15-August 5, 2026 Faculty Adjuncts, Philosophy Security Officers Faculty Adjuncts, School of Business and Information Sciences Instructor, School of Nursing Faculty Adjunct, Communications Assistant Coach, Women’s Soccer Academic Success Coach JV Men’s Soccer Coach and Athletics Coordinator Full Time Faculty, Mathematics Assistant Professor, Cybersecurity and Computer Sciences Adjunct Faculty, Religious Studies Associate Director for Academic Operations Assistant Coach, Men’s Soccer Clinical Adjunct Faculty, Hybrid ABSN, Parsippany, School of Nursing Associate Director of Housing Operations Associate Director of Transfer Student Success Part-Time Professional Science Tutor Administrative Specialist for Student Success & Accessibility Services Building and Grounds Assistant Attitude Against Violence Project Coordinator Assistant/Associate Professor, Chemistry Head Coach, Women’s Acrobatics and Tumbling Assistant Professor, Marketing Assessment Data Coordinator Engagement and Philanthropy Officer Director of Internships and Assessment, School of Education Assistant Sports Information Director and Intramurals Coordinator Assistant Professor, Management and Entrepreneurial Studies Head Coach, Men’s Soccer Head Coach, eSports Prelicensure Nursing Program, Parsippany NJ – Clinical Adjunct Faculty Associate Professor – PsyD Counseling Psychology Program Campus Security: Part-time Security Officer Assistant Director, Center for Career and Professional Development Assistant/Associate Professor of Chemistry Management/Entrepreneurial Studies Faculty Inter-Campus Shuttle Bus Drivers Inter-Campus Shuttle Bus Drivers Half-Time Instructor, Prelicensure Nursing IT Help Desk Support Technician – Temporary Director of Institutional Assessment and Accreditation Full-time Faculty, Prelicensure Nursing Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions Assistant/Associate Professor, Exercise Sports Science Assistant Professor and Academic Fieldwork Coordinator, Master’s Occupational Therapy Program Evening and Weekend Circulation Supervisor Research and Instruction Librarian Faculty Adjunct – Mathematics Assistant Women’s Basketball Coach and Equipment Manager Adjunct Faculty, English Conference and Event Services Directions & Maps On Campus Tours History & Tradition Office of the President Senior Administrative Officers Alumni REED Autism Services Partnership Felician University, the Franciscan University of New Jersey is seeking an experienced Building and Grounds Assistant to perform a variety of tasks associated with the safety, repair and maintenance of the buildings and grounds at multiple sites of Felician University.  The job responsibilities address a variety of tasks in the maintenance and repair of the buildings and grounds at multiple sites of the University, including but not limited to the areas of carpentry, electrical, plumbing, glazier, masonry and painting. Felician University is committed to maintaining a learning and employment environment based upon our core values of Respect for Human Dignity , Compassion , Transformation , Justice and Peace, and Solidarity with People in Need. We offer a choice of medical, dental, vision, and life insurance benefits, as well as a retirement plan (403B), tuition remission, and generous time off benefits. Position Type: Full-time, 12-months, non-exempt Department: University Building and Grounds Date Posted: August 13, 2021 Required Education: High school diploma or GED Qualifications: Knowledge of and demonstrated experience in repair, maintenance and replacement in the areas of carpentry, painting, plumbing, glass replacement, masonry, appliance repair, HVAC, and electrical wiring. Ability to perform a variety of physical tasks, including but not limited to climbing ladders, bending, kneeling, reaching and standing for long periods of time, lifting and carrying boxes, tools, equipment and building materials. Ability to maintain and utilize a variety of hand and power tools. Knowledge of safety practices and procedures related to building and construction. Ability to read blueprints. Good written and verbal communications skills. Basic computer skills. Possession of a valid New Jersey Driver’s License. Willingness and ability to work outdoors in all weather conditions. Willingness and ability to work overtime on an as needed basis. Demonstrated fluency in written and spoken English. Willingness and ability to support and promote the Felician Franciscan mission and values of the University. To Apply: Please email cover letter, 2 references and resume electronically to the Director or via USPS to: Ms. Meggan O’Neill, Director University Buildings and Grounds Felician University 1 Felician Way Rutherford, New Jersey 07070 Start Date: August 2021 About Felician University Accreditations Public Disclosure of Student Achievement Alumni Board of Trustees Members Careers at Felician Academic Success Coach Adjunct Faculty, English Adjunct Faculty, Information Literacy Adjunct Faculty, Religious Studies Administrative Specialist for Student Success & Accessibility Services Assessment Data Coordinator Assistant Coach, Men’s Soccer Assistant Coach, Women’s Soccer Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions Assistant Director, Center for Career and Professional Development Assistant Professor and Academic Fieldwork Coordinator, Master’s Occupational Therapy Program Assistant Professor, Cybersecurity and Computer Sciences Assistant Professor, Management and Entrepreneurial Studies Assistant Professor, Marketing Assistant Professor, Prelicensure Nursing Assistant Sports Information Director and Intramurals Coordinator Assistant Women’s Basketball Coach and Equipment Manager Assistant/Associate Professor of Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Exercise Sports Science Assistant/Associate Professor, Mathematics Associate Director for Academic Operations Associate Director of Housing Operations Associate Director of Student Accounts Associate Director of Student Financial Services Operations Associate Director of Transfer Student Success Associate Professor – PsyD Counseling Psychology Program Attitude Against Violence Project Coordinator Building and Grounds Assistant Campus Security: Part-time Security Officer Clinical Adjunct Faculty, Hybrid ABSN, Parsippany, School of Nursing Clinical Adjunct Faculty, School of Nursing, Traditional ABSN, Rutherfod NJ Director of Institutional Assessment and Accreditation Director of Internships and Assessment, School of Education Engagement and Philanthropy Officer Evening and Weekend Circulation Supervisor Faculty Adjunct – Mathematics Faculty Adjunct – Graduate Nursing Faculty Adjunct, Communications Faculty Adjuncts, Philosophy Faculty Adjuncts, School of Business and Information Sciences Full Time Faculty, Mathematics Full-time Faculty – School of Nursing Full-time Faculty, Prelicensure Nursing Half-Time Instructor, Prelicensure Nursing Head Coach, eSports Head Coach, Men’s Soccer Head Coach, Women’s Acrobatics and Tumbling Instructor, School of Nursing Inter-Campus Shuttle Bus Drivers Inter-Campus Shuttle Bus Drivers IT Help D