erience working with a multicultural and diverse student population. Willingness and ability to support the Felician Franciscan mission of the University. Salary: Commensurate with experience and rank Start Date: August 2021 To Apply: Review of candidate materials will begin immediately. Send cover letter, curriculum vitae and contact information of three (3) professional references who can speak to your qualifications for the position. In the cover letter, applicants should include the following: reasons for interest in the position, teaching experience, research conducted, personal research interests, and a brief statement of teaching philosophy. Materials may be sent electronically to Dean or via USPS to: Dr. Mildred Mihlon, Dean School of Arts and Sciences Felician University 262 South Main Street Lodi, New Jersey  07644 About Felician University Accreditations Public Disclosure of Student Achievement Alumni Board of Trustees Members Careers at Felician Academic Success Coach Adjunct Faculty, English Adjunct Faculty, Information Literacy Adjunct Faculty, Religious Studies Administrative Specialist for Student Success & Accessibility Services Assessment Data Coordinator Assistant Coach, Men’s Soccer Assistant Coach, Women’s Soccer Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions Assistant Director, Center for Career and Professional Development Assistant Professor and Academic Fieldwork Coordinator, Master’s Occupational Therapy Program Assistant Professor, Cybersecurity and Computer Sciences Assistant Professor, Management and Entrepreneurial Studies Assistant Professor, Marketing Assistant Professor, Prelicensure Nursing Assistant Sports Information Director and Intramurals Coordinator Assistant Women’s Basketball Coach and Equipment Manager Assistant/Associate Professor of Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Exercise Sports Science Assistant/Associate Professor, Ma