 record of related research and scholarship; demonstrated experience working with a multicultural and highly diverse student population; ability and willingness to successfully complete Felician University online certification; ability and willingness to support and promote the Franciscan Felician mission and values of the University. To Apply: Send cover letter, resume and 3 professional references electronically to: Dean or via USPS to: Dr. Mildred Mihlon Dean, School of Arts and Sciences Felician University 262 South Main Street Lodi, New Jersey 07070 Salary: Commensurate with rank and experience About Felician University Accreditations Public Disclosure of Student Achievement Alumni Board of Trustees Members Careers at Felician Academic Success Coach Adjunct Faculty, English Adjunct Faculty, Information Literacy Adjunct Faculty, Religious Studies Administrative Specialist for Student Success & Accessibility Services Assessment Data Coordinator Assistant Coach, Men’s Soccer Assistant Coach, Women’s Soccer Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions Assistant Director, Center for Career and Professional Development Assistant Professor and Academic Fieldwork Coordinator, Master’s Occupational Therapy Program Assistant Professor, Cybersecurity and Computer Sciences Assistant Professor, Management and Entrepreneurial Studies Assistant Professor, Marketing Assistant Professor, Prelicensure Nursing Assistant Sports Information Director and Intramurals Coordinator Assistant Women’s Basketball Coach and Equipment Manager Assistant/Associate Professor of Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Exercise Sports Science Assistant/Associate Professor, Mathematics Associate Director for Academic Operations Associate Director of Housing Operations Associate Director of Student Accounts Associate Director of Student Financial Services Operations Associate Director of Transfer Studen