nter-Campus Shuttle Bus Drivers Felician University is seeking a safety-conscious, flexible, and dependable bus drivers who enjoy working with students in a college environment. The bus driver is responsible for transporting students, staff, and faculty between the Lodi and Rutherford campuses, as well as to approved off-campus events. S/he ensures that transportation vehicles are in a safe, clean operational mode through regular inspection of the vehicles utilized, and timely, thorough, and accurate reporting of safety and/or cleanliness issues to the Transportation Manager. Position Type: Full-time, 12-month, Non-exempt Department: Transportation Date Posted: February 21, 2024 Required Education: High School diploma or equivalent required Qualifications: Valid New Jersey driver’s license and certifications appropriate for the operation of respective vehicles; CDL Driver Class B license; safe driving record which meets the insurance requirements of the university; ability to read and interpret maps; ability to establish and maintain proper conduct and safety of passengers; demonstrated ability to exercise sound judgment, caution, and composure at all times when operating transportation vehicles; level of fluency in verbal and written English sufficient to successfully perform required duties; skill in establishing and maintaining effective work relationships with those contacted in the performance of duties; ability to identify mechanical and safety hazards in a variety of transportation vehicles;  physical requirements essential to safely and effectively perform required duties; thorough understanding of proper safety requirements for individuals with physical challenges; flexibility in adjusting work schedule to meet the needs of students, staff ,and faculty for transportation needs outside of the regular work schedule; ability and willingness to support and promote the Felician Franciscan mission and core values of the University. To Apply: Send cover letter, resume, and the names and contact information for (two) 2 professional references electronically to the Manager or via USPS to: Kamal Tawadros, Transportation Manager Felician University 1 Felician Way Rutherford, New Jersey 07070 About Felician University Accreditations Public Disclosure of Student Achievement Alumni Board of Trustees Members Careers at Felician Academic Success Coach Adjunct Faculty, English Adjunct Faculty, Information Literacy Adjunct Faculty, Religious Studies Administrative Specialist for Student Success & Accessibility Services Assessment Data Coordinator Assistant Coach, Men’s Soccer Assistant Coach, Women’s Soccer Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions Assistant Director, Center for Career and Professional Development Assistant Professor and Academic Fieldwork Coordinator, Master’s Occupational Therapy Program Assistant Professor, Cybersecurity and Computer Sciences Assistant Professor, Management and Entrepreneurial Studies Assistant Professor, Marketing Assistant Professor, Prelicensure Nursing Assistant Sports Information Director and Intramurals Coordinator Assistant Women’s Basketball Coach and Equipment Manager Assistant/Associate Professor of Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Exercise Sports Science Assistant/Associate Professor, Mathematics Associate Director for Academic Operations Associate Director of Housing Operations Associate Director of Student Accounts Associate Director of Student Financial Services Operations Associate Director of Transfer Student Success Associate Professor – PsyD Counseling Psychology Program Attitude Against Violence Project Coordinator Building and Grounds Assistant Campus Security: Part-time Security Officer Clinical Adjunct Faculty, Hybrid ABSN, Parsippany, School of Nursing Clinical Adjunct Faculty, School of Nursing, Traditional ABSN, Rutherfod NJ Director of Institutional Assessment and Accr