 at Felician Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions Felician University is presently seeking an innovative, highly motivated, flexible and goal-oriented professional to serve as the Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions at Felician University.   Assistant Director provides support in the planning and implementation of recruitment strategies designed to increase enrollment of undergraduate freshmen and Educational Opportunity Fund students.  S/he participates in all aspects of admissions work, including but not limited to:  evaluation of applicant credentials; interviewing prospective students; organization and management of special events; engaging in social media and developing online and mobile communications. Position Type: Full-time, 12-months, Exempt Department: Undergraduate Admissions Date Posted: June 2023 Required Education: BA/BS required Qualifications: 2-3 years’ enrollment/admissions experience in higher education; superior written and verbal communication skills; valid driver’s license, ability and willingness to travel; excellent platform skills; well-developed organizational and time-management skills; highly advanced interpersonal skills, ability to engage effectively with diverse groups;  availability and willingness to work evenings and weekends as needed; demonstrated ability to exercise sound judgment when interacting with students, staff, faculty and other internal and external stakeholders;  knowledge of computer databases and information systems; ability to direct and supervise the activities of Student Ambassadors; ability to articulate the benefits of a broad-based liberal arts Catholic education; willingness and ability to support and promote the Felician Franciscan mission and values of the University. To Apply: Send cover letter, resume and 2 professional references electronically to: Office of Admissions or via USPS to: Ms. Kelsey Dennehy Director, Undergraduate Admissions 1 Felician Way Rutherford, New Jersey 07070 Salary: Commensurate with experience Start Date: TBD About Felician University Accreditations Public Disclosure of Student Achievement Alumni Board of Trustees Members Careers at Felician Academic Success Coach Adjunct Faculty, English Adjunct Faculty, Information Literacy Adjunct Faculty, Religious Studies Administrative Specialist for Student Success & Accessibility Services Assessment Data Coordinator Assistant Coach, Men’s Soccer Assistant Coach, Women’s Soccer Assistant Director of Enrollment Management Services Assistant Director of Undergraduate Admissions Assistant Director, Center for Career and Professional Development Assistant Professor and Academic Fieldwork Coordinator, Master’s Occupational Therapy Program Assistant Professor, Cybersecurity and Computer Sciences Assistant Professor, Management and Entrepreneurial Studies Assistant Professor, Marketing Assistant Professor, Prelicensure Nursing Assistant Sports Information Director and Intramurals Coordinator Assistant Women’s Basketball Coach and Equipment Manager Assistant/Associate Professor of Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Chemistry Assistant/Associate Professor, Exercise Sports Science Assistant/Associate Professor, Mathematics Associate Director for Academic Operations Associate Director of Housing Operations Associate Director of Student Accounts Associate Director of Student Financial Services Operations Associate Director of Transfer Student Success Associate Professor – PsyD Counseling Psychology Program Attitude Against Violence Project Coordinator Building and Grounds Assistant Campus Security: Part-time Security Officer Clinical Adjunct Faculty, Hybrid ABSN, Parsippany, School of Nursing Clinical Adjunct Faculty, School of Nursing, Traditional ABSN, Rutherfod NJ Director of Institutional Assessment and Accreditation Director of Internships and Assessment, School of Education Engagement and Philanthropy Officer Evening and Weekend Circulation Supervisor Faculty Adjunct – Mathematics 